%description:
TDD is modelled for NR cells only: a carrier's TDD symbol split scales the resource elements per
block in the NR AMC, and the LTE AMC does not read it. An eNodeB on a carrier with useTdd = true
would have the capacity of FDD in both directions, without a message. It is an error at
initialization.

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
network = simu5g.test.moduletest.lib.EpcSessionTestNetwork

*.carrierAggregation.componentCarrier[0].useTdd = true

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%exitcode: 1
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stderr
carrier 2 GHz is TDD, and TDD is modelled for NR cells only
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
